    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/66bd8af5d07658f40fb00977d8e6c22e.poster.avif?t=1750967645\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/66bd8af5d07658f40fb00977d8e6c22e.webm?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/66bd8af5d07658f40fb00977d8e6c22e.mp4?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Forget swords and axes. Here, the battles take place in the minds of the heroes: cute monks and elderly folks with one goal: to meditate!<br><br>But it won\u2019t be easy. Stress, bills, heartbreaks, and other enemies will try to disturb our heroes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c77a7890d03476fa2ff1f699a0dababc.poster.avif?t=1750967645\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c77a7890d03476fa2ff1f699a0dababc.webm?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c77a7890d03476fa2ff1f699a0dababc.mp4?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your weapon is music! </h2>Build a deck of cards to prevent the enemies from reaching the monks' peace. Collect relics to increase your powers. And play your instrument until you reach 100% serenity and win all the mental battles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/d2d5c76301afa2af96ed622a0f2cf127.poster.avif?t=1750967645\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/d2d5c76301afa2af96ed622a0f2cf127.webm?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/d2d5c76301afa2af96ed622a0f2cf127.mp4?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are several hand-drawn scenarios! And like a good roguelike deckbuilder, reaching the end will require skill in combining the right cards and relics and choosing the right paths on the map!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> 100+ different relics and curses<br></li><li> 100+ different cards<br></li><li> 4 different characters and counting, each playing a different instrument <br></li><li> dozens of beautiful scenarios<br></li><li> 30+ different enemies to disturb the monks <br></li><li> soundtrack exclusively composed for the game <br></li><li> a map with always random events, making each run different! <br></li><li> all the art hand-drawn by professional human illustrators </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c990c011baa71ef5a9eb6a3c015f6d1b.poster.avif?t=1750967645\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c990c011baa71ef5a9eb6a3c015f6d1b.webm?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c990c011baa71ef5a9eb6a3c015f6d1b.mp4?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/66bd8af5d07658f40fb00977d8e6c22e.poster.avif?t=1750967645\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/66bd8af5d07658f40fb00977d8e6c22e.webm?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/66bd8af5d07658f40fb00977d8e6c22e.mp4?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Forget swords and axes. Here, the battles take place in the minds of the heroes: cute monks and elderly folks with one goal: to meditate!<br><br>But it won\u2019t be easy. Stress, bills, heartbreaks, and other enemies will try to disturb our heroes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c77a7890d03476fa2ff1f699a0dababc.poster.avif?t=1750967645\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c77a7890d03476fa2ff1f699a0dababc.webm?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c77a7890d03476fa2ff1f699a0dababc.mp4?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your weapon is music! </h2>Build a deck of cards to prevent the enemies from reaching the monks' peace. Collect relics to increase your powers. And play your instrument until you reach 100% serenity and win all the mental battles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/d2d5c76301afa2af96ed622a0f2cf127.poster.avif?t=1750967645\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/d2d5c76301afa2af96ed622a0f2cf127.webm?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/d2d5c76301afa2af96ed622a0f2cf127.mp4?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are several hand-drawn scenarios! And like a good roguelike deckbuilder, reaching the end will require skill in combining the right cards and relics and choosing the right paths on the map!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> 100+ different relics and curses<br></li><li> 100+ different cards<br></li><li> 4 different characters and counting, each playing a different instrument <br></li><li> dozens of beautiful scenarios<br></li><li> 30+ different enemies to disturb the monks <br></li><li> soundtrack exclusively composed for the game <br></li><li> a map with always random events, making each run different! <br></li><li> all the art hand-drawn by professional human illustrators </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c990c011baa71ef5a9eb6a3c015f6d1b.poster.avif?t=1750967645\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c990c011baa71ef5a9eb6a3c015f6d1b.webm?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c990c011baa71ef5a9eb6a3c015f6d1b.mp4?t=1750967645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
